lt":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-02-28T09:45:26Z","updated_at":"2025-11-27T15:34:58Z","closed_at":"2025-11-27T15:34:55Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.3.stable.mono.official [77dcf97d8]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable.mono - macOS 14.6.1 - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Apple M2 Max - Apple M2 Max (12 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI created a resource with a getter,\n\n```gdscript\nextends Resource\nclass_name R\n\nvar helloworld: int :\n\tget:\n\t\treturn 1\n```\n\nThe getter behaves as expected when I run the project (\"1\" is printed).\nBut calling that getter in a tool throws an \"Invalid access to property or key\" error\n\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends Node\n\n@export var r: R\n\n@export var print_helloworld: bool:\n\tset(value):\n\t\t_helloworld()\n\nfunc _helloworld():\n\tprint_debug(r)\n\tprint_debug(r.helloworld)\n\nfunc _ready():\n\tif not Engine.is_editor_hint():\n\t\tprint_debug(r)\n\t\tprint_debug(r.helloworld)\n```\n\nClicking on \"print_helloworld\" in the editor throws:\n\n```\nres://main.gd:12 - Invalid access to property or key 'helloworld' on a base object of type 'Resource (R)'.\n```\n\nTrying to `@export` the property get rids of the error, but it doesn't call the getter:\n\n```gdscript\n@export var helloworld: int :\n```\n\nThis will print helloworld = 0 instead of 1 when you click on \"print_helloworld\" in the editor.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nDetailed above, see also repos below\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nBase error:\nhttps://github.com/laurentsenta/godot_issue_getter_tool/tree/5276e8f9d3e6b7aa9f69abd65687259318fc2bc3\n\nTrying to use export (not calling the getter at all):\nhttps://github.com/laurentsenta/godot_issue_getter_tool/tree/17679d430495e17680329aefadf4d73f2aa549b3","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103389/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103389/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}